"In order to successfully use &kmouth;, you need a speech synthesizer (and of "
"course &kde; 3.x). &kmouth; uses about 15 MB of memory to run (plus the "
"amount of memory needed by your speech synthesizer), but this may vary "
"depending on your platform and configuration."
